ad as the meaning: gaining profit from several sources. mendapat untung di sana-sini appears right after the proverb marker, but the layout makes it hard to confirm that it belongs to this entry.\n- **Separate entry for \"matahari\":** \"matahari naik\" appears on its own as a proverb, meaning a time marker of roughly 08.00 or 09.00. matahari naik, pb alamat waktu, kira-kira pukul 08.00 atau 09.00. This is a different phrase from the one you asked about.\n- **Entry for \"bulan\":** The \"bulan\" entries include \"bulan naik\" as a term for the moon rising, not as part of a proverb. bulan timbul bulan naik; bulan terbit.\n\nPlease check the proverb's meaning directly on kbbi.kemendikbud.go.id, since these snippets come from third-party mirrors (typoonline.com and kbbi.web.id)."], "durationSeconds": 6.587131874999999, "searchCount": 1}, "tool_result_meta": [{"id": "toolu_011d5JX2XMtLkmgmwKrG2txg", "permission_decision": {"decision": "accept", "source": "hook", "reason_type": "hook"}}]}
