{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgEQqvZYdSzTPfSQaz4YN", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：**按 KBBI 的解释，这句谚语（pb）的意思是“mendapat untung di sana-sini”，也就是四处都有收获、财源从好几个方向来。月亮升起、太阳也升起，好比各处都“亮”起来、都在走运。\n\n**说明：**\n- 我共搜了 2 次。这个释义来自第三方的 KBBI 镜像站（typoonline.com 上的 *naik* 词条）。搜索摘要的排版很乱，我没能百分之百确认这句释义就是属于这条谚语的。没有去 kbbi.kemendikbud.go.id 官方站核对。\n- 别和 KBBI 里另一个词条混淆：单独的“matahari naik”是表示时间的说法，指上午大约 8 点到 9 点。\n\nSources:\n- [typoonline.com – KBBI: naik](https://typoonline.com/kbbi/naik)\n- [typoonline.com – KBBI: matahari](https://typoonline.com/kbbi/matahari)\n- [kbbi.web.id – bulan](https://kbbi.web.id/bulan)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1119, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5111, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1119}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:10:21.946Z", "request_id": "req_011CgEQqvFCAEZq1ksHDHvCZ"}
